{"seq":2,"slug":"procedural-locomotion","title":"程序化行走","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/dynamics/procedural-locomotion","wordCount":1818,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"程序化行走\">程序化行走</h1><p>给一只八条腿的蜘蛛做行走动画，要为每条腿、每种地形、每个转向都做一遍——这条路走不通。换个思路：不做任何走路动画，而是每帧用射线为每条腿在地面上找一个该踩的点，再用相位机决定哪条腿现在该抬、该迈、该落。这就是程序化行走（procedural locomotion）——让多足生物、机械装甲、甚至非人形怪物在任意地形上自动生成步态。这一篇讲这套「射线找落点 + 相位驱动迈步」的机制，并划清它与 Motion Matching 的边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>程序化行走的核心洞察：<strong>脚不该跟着身体连续移动，而该「抬起—迈到新落点—踩下—固定」地离散迈步</strong>。身体（根）平滑前移，腿则在身体走出一定距离后才迈一步追上。每条腿循环于两个相位：支撑相（stance，脚钉在地面，身体相对它前移）与摆动相（swing，脚抬起飞向下一个落点）。把多条腿的相位错开协调，就得到步态（gait）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[身体根 平滑前移] --&gt; B[对每条腿: 当前落点离身体多远?]&#10;  B --&gt; C{超过步长阈值&lt;br/&gt;且该腿可迈?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[支撑相: 脚钉住&lt;br/&gt;IK 锁在原落点]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[射线在前方探新落点]&#10;  E --&gt; F[摆动相: 脚沿弧线&lt;br/&gt;抬起-前移-落下]&#10;  F --&gt; G[落地 转入支撑相]&#10;  D --&gt; H[两骨 IK 解腿姿]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[身体根 平滑前移] --&gt; B[对每条腿: 当前落点离身体多远?]\n  B --&gt; C{超过步长阈值&lt;br/&gt;且该腿可迈?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[支撑相: 脚钉住&lt;br/&gt;IK 锁在原落点]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[射线在前方探新落点]\n  E --&gt; F[摆动相: 脚沿弧线&lt;br/&gt;抬起-前移-落下]\n  F --&gt; G[落地 转入支撑相]\n  D --&gt; H[两骨 IK 解腿姿]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>整套系统是「身体运动驱动 + IK 执行 + 相位协调」三者的合奏。下表对比几种常见步态的协调方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步态</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>腿的相位关系</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交替四足（trot/tetrapod）</td>\n<td>蜘蛛、四足兽小跑</td>\n<td>对角腿同相，两组交替</td>\n<td>中，快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波动（wave/ripple）</td>\n<td>蜈蚣、慢速多足</td>\n<td>依次错开一点点</td>\n<td>高，慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双足交替</td>\n<td>人形、鸟</td>\n<td>左右严格反相</td>\n<td>低，需平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自由异步</td>\n<td>攀爬、不规则地形</td>\n<td>各腿独立按需迈</td>\n<td>高，自然</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"射线找落点-脚该踩哪\">射线找落点：脚该踩哪</h2><p>每条腿都有一个「期望落点」——通常是它在身体下方的默认位置（rest position）随身体一起前移投影到地面的点。具体落点靠射线探地求得：从期望落点上方向下射线，命中地面得到真实落点（高度+法线），原理与<a href=\"../ik/foot-placement\">足部贴地</a>完全一致，区别在于这里探的是「下一步该踩哪」而非「站着时脚该多高」。</p>\n<p>关键判定是<strong>何时该迈步</strong>。给每条腿一个「当前实际落点」（上一步钉住的位置）。随着身体前移，这个钉住的落点会越来越落在身体后方；当「当前落点到期望落点的距离」超过步长阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，就触发这条腿进入摆动相，去探一个新落点并迈过去。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大步幅越大、迈步越少。这个「钉住—超阈值—迈步」机制本质就是<a href=\"../ik/foot-placement\">足部贴地</a>里讲的足锁（foot locking），只是这里主动用它来生成步态而非仅防打滑。</p>\n<p>落点选择还要避坑：不能选在悬崖外（射线没命中或命中点过低就放弃该落点、缩短步幅）、不能选在太陡处、相邻腿的落点不该太近（防腿打架）。蜘蛛爬墙这类还要让射线朝表面法线方向而非一律朝下，使腿能贴附任意朝向的表面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相位机-让多条腿协调迈步\">相位机：让多条腿协调迈步</h2><p>如果每条腿独立地「该迈就迈」，多条腿可能同时抬起导致身体没有支撑而塌陷。需要一个<strong>相位协调</strong>机制保证任意时刻有足够多的脚在地面支撑（静态稳定要求重心投影落在支撑脚围成的多边形内）。</p>\n<p>最简单的协调是<strong>分组交替</strong>：把腿分成两组（如蜘蛛按对角分两组四足），规定一组全在支撑相时另一组才能进摆动相，两组交替——这就是「交替四足步态（alternating tetrapod gait）」，模仿真实蜘蛛走法，简单且总有四脚着地很稳。更平滑的做法是给每条腿一个<strong>相位偏移</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i \\in [0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，所有腿共享一个全局相位时钟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 条腿在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(t)+\\phi_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 进入摆动窗口；把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 沿身体依次错开就得到波动步态（像蜈蚣的腿波）。</p>\n<p>摆动相里脚不是直线移到新落点，而是走一条<strong>抬起弧线</strong>：用一段抛物线或正弦插值让脚先抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>lift</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{\\text{lift}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lift</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 再落下，避免拖地。落地时机和动画的「踏地」要对齐，否则会有滑步感。整套相位逻辑跑在身体速度之上——身体走得快，相位时钟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 转得快，迈步频率自动提高，无需切换动画。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界-与-motion-matching-的分工\">边界：与 Motion Matching 的分工</h2><p>程序化行走不是万能的，它有清晰的适用边界，搞混会做出别扭的角色。</p>\n<p><strong>程序化行走最适合</strong>：多足/非人形生物（蜘蛛、机甲、外星怪），它们的腿做全套动画代价极高、且要适应任意地形；以及那些刻意追求「机械精确步态」的设计（如波士顿动力风格的机器人）。它的强项是地形适应性与零动画成本，弱项是<strong>缺少表演</strong>——纯程序化的人形行走往往僵硬、没有真人走路的重心起伏、手臂摆动、身体侧倾这些微妙表演。</p>\n<p><strong>人形主角的行走则更该用 Motion Matching 或 Blend Tree</strong>：用动捕数据库现选最匹配当前速度方向的真人走跑片段，保留全部表演，再叠加<a href=\"../ik/foot-placement\">足部贴地 IK</a> 修正地形——这是「美术动画基底 + 程序化微调」的第三档（见<a href=\"../foundations/procedural-spectrum\">程序化光谱</a>）。Motion Matching 本身属于动画播放体系，详见<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/playback-blending/state-machines\">动画系统的状态机与混合</a>，不在本 hub 展开。</p>\n<p>一句话分工：<strong>有真人参考、要表演的人形腿，用动画+IK；没法做动画或要机械感的非人形腿，用程序化行走。</strong> 二者也能混搭——人形上半身用动画，某个外骨骼/机械尾用程序化步态。落点稳定后的腿姿求解，两者都回到<a href=\"../ik/ik-solvers\">两骨 IK</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>程序化行走的核心：脚离散迈步（支撑相钉住、摆动相飞向新落点）而非连续移动；身体平滑前移，腿按需追上。</li>\n<li>落点用射线探地求得（同足部贴地）；「当前落点离期望落点超过步长阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」触发迈步，本质是主动运用足锁。</li>\n<li>相位机协调多腿：分组交替（交替四足步态，总有脚着地很稳）或相位偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 错开（波动步态）；保证支撑多边形含重心。</li>\n<li>摆动脚走抬起弧线避免拖地；相位时钟随身体速度加快，迈步频率自动适配，无需切换动画。</li>\n<li>边界：非人形/机械/无动画参考的腿用程序化行走；有动捕、要表演的人形腿用 Motion Matching/Blend Tree + 足部 IK。两者落点后都回到两骨 IK。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../ik/foot-placement\">足部贴地</a>（落点探测与足锁，本篇直接复用）、<a href=\"../ik/ik-solvers\">IK 求解器</a>（腿姿求解）、<a href=\"../foundations/procedural-spectrum\">程序化光谱</a>（程序化行走属第四档的定位）、<a href=\"../practice/procedural-tuning\">手感调校</a>（步长/抬腿高度等参数）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/playback-blending/state-machines\">动画系统 — 状态机与混合</a>（人形行走该用的 Motion Matching/状态机，与程序化行走的边界）。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>步态生成与交替四足模型参考开源「Unity Procedural IK Wall-Walking Spider」项目（github.com/PhilS94）与多足机器人步态优化研究（link.springer.com），2026 年访问。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"程序化行走","id":"程序化行走"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"射线找落点：脚该踩哪","id":"射线找落点-脚该踩哪"},{"level":2,"text":"相位机：让多条腿协调迈步","id":"相位机-让多条腿协调迈步"},{"level":2,"text":"边界：与 Motion Matching 的分工","id":"边界-与-motion-matching-的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"二级动态与弹簧骨","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/dynamics/secondary-motion"},"next":{"title":"布偶混合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/dynamics/ragdoll-blending"}}